notterizmus (1.1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Ctrl+Space: spelling fixes and word completion; item type cycling
    moved to Ctrl+Shift+Space.
  * Number hotkeys 1-9, 0 in the Alt+Insert, item and Ctrl+Space popups.
  * The view follows the cursor, so Enter at the bottom of a full window
    no longer hides it.
  * Notes stay in the real Documents folder when running as a snap.

